        "content": "# Lower Manhattan in motion\n\n996 yellow-cab trips replayed over the buildings of Lower Manhattan. Each trail is one taxi:\nthe bright head is where the cab is now, and the tail fades behind it. **Press play on the\nmap's clock**; drag with the right button to orbit.\n\nThe data is the example that ships with deck.gl ([visgl/deck.gl-data](https://github.com/visgl/deck.gl-data/tree/master/examples/trips)),\nread in place from GitHub on every load. Its timestamps count seconds from an unnamed start, so the\nclock runs from 00:00 to 00:41 and says nothing about the real hour. The sample was cut at the\n30-minute mark — 279 trips end within ten seconds of it — which is why the count below falls off a\ncliff there.",
